      "rating": "justified",
      "basis": "The initial action was targeted inspection rather than acceptance, repair, or escalation. That is consistent with unresolved provenance around the broader ZCRM02 boundary and a reported but non-authoritative ticket-source concern. It avoided treating participant reports, portal/navigation evidence, keyword matches, or lint/source evidence as authoritative business confirmation."
